        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1990 European Cup Final\n- Organizations: Milan, Benfica\n- People: Alessandro Costacurta, Marco van Basten, Frank Rijkaard\n- Places: Italy, Portugal\n- Roles: footballer, manager, midfielder, defender\n\nFacts:\n- The 1990 European Cup Final was a football match between Milan of Italy and Benfica of Portugal played on 23 May 1990.\n- In the 68th minute of the 1990 European Cup Final, Alessandro Costacurta passed to Marco van Basten, who set up Frank Rijkaard to score Milan's winning goal.\n- Frank Rijkaard, whose full name is Franklin Edmundo Rijkaard, is a Dutch former footballer and former manager.\n- Frank Rijkaard played as a midfielder or defender.",
